module Core

### Represents the aggregate protocol for tagged-union variant types.
### `VariantType` identifies sum types whose value is one of a fixed set of member types,
### discriminated by the stored type tag. Like `RecordType`, it bundles no capabilities:
### represent/diagnose/serialize are universal built-in operations (every value has them), not
### opt-in protocols; and `Equatable`/`Hashable` are hand-written promises a variant opts into
### explicitly (bundling them would leave an abstract method behind for constrained generics).
protocol VariantType
  pass
